    "title": "Houston Police Officer Shoots Armed Man with Knife in SW Houston - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago\nSouthwest Houston- Police are investigating an officer-involved shooting at the Bennington Square Apartments. Early reports say the officers discharged their weapons at a man who was armed with a knife.\nThe suspect was struck during the incident, and it is unknown the extent of the injuries. No officers were injured in the incident.\nDetails surrounding what led up to the shooting have not yet been disclosed.",
